████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
 🚨 ERRORS & TROUBLESHOOTING
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████

 🔴 PROMPT AMBIGUITY
    Root Cause  : System prompt instructions do not explicitly distinguish
                  overlapping boundaries (e.g., billing technicalities vs
                  general billing).
    🟢 Fix      : Update system prompt with explicit boundary definitions and
                  few-shot examples.

 🔴 MODEL CAPACITY DEFICIT
    Root Cause  : Small or low-parameter base models struggle with nuanced
                  language classification.
    🟢 Fix      : Upgrade to a higher-capacity LLM or fine-tune a specialized
                  model.

 🔴 PRODUCTION MISROUTING
    Root Cause  : Out-of-distribution user emails present novel phrasing not
                  covered in initial test data.
    🟢 Fix      : Implement production error logging, extract misclassified
                  emails, and append them to the Golden Dataset.

 🔴 STALE BENCHMARK DATA
    Root Cause  : Golden Dataset does not reflect shifting user query
                  distributions over time.
    🟢 Fix      : Continuously refresh Golden Datasets using production
                  sampling flywheels.


