--- 2. 🧮 Evaluation Methods Comparison ----------------------------------------

 🤖 AUTOMATED (CODE-BASED)
    Best Used For : Categorical outputs, exact matches, JSON/structured data.
    🟢 Advantages : Fast, deterministic, zero marginal cost, easy to integrate
                    into CI/CD.
    🔴 Limitations: Cannot evaluate semantic nuance in long-form text.

 👤 HUMAN EVALUATION
    Best Used For : Subjective assessment, creative content, nuanced domain
                    review.
    🟢 Advantages : High accuracy and deep alignment with human preference.
    🔴 Limitations: Expensive, slow, non-scalable, inconsistent across
                    annotators.

 ⚖️ LLM-AS-A-JUDGE
    Best Used For : Long-form generation, RAG answer relevance, summarization
                    quality.
    🟢 Advantages : Scalable, handles semantic comparison without exact
                    keyword match.
    🔴 Limitations: Subject to judge bias, API cost, and potential
                    non-determinism.


