 🎯 KEY TAKEAWAYS
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████

 ⭐ 1. 🛡️ Evaluation Prevents Operational Failures
        Building an LLM app takes minutes, but establishing reliability through
        structured evaluation is what makes it production-ready.

 ⭐ 2. 🔀 Application Evals Differ from Model Evals
        Application evals focus on business logic, task accuracy, and system
        integration rather than generic LLM benchmarks.

 ⭐ 3. 🏆 The Golden Dataset is Foundational
        High-quality inputs paired with verified ground-truth labels enable
        repeatable, automated testing.

 ⭐ 4. ⚖️ Choose the Right Evaluator
        Use automated code for categorical data, LLM judges for unstructured
        text, and humans for subjective validation.

 ⭐ 5. 🔄 Evaluation is a Continuous Loop
        Post-deployment monitoring feeds live production failures back into the
        Golden Dataset, ensuring long-term system resilience.


