 📚 GLOSSARY
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████

  APPLICATION EVAL
     Assessment of an end-to-end LLM system built for a specific enterprise
     task.

  GOLDEN DATASET
     A curated benchmark dataset of inputs and validated ground-truth outputs
     used as a standard for evaluation.

  LLM-AS-A-JUDGE
     The technique of utilizing a language model to evaluate the output
     quality of another language model.

  MODEL EVAL
     Assessment of a foundation model's general capabilities across
     standardized academic benchmarks.

  PRODUCTION FLYWHEEL
     The continuous cycle where production failures are captured, labeled,
     and added to evaluation datasets to retrain or refine systems.

  SYSTEM PROMPT
     Instructions given to an LLM that define its role, behavior, constraints,
     and output requirements.

